{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021b.q22.material.recovered", "text": "材料：一（2）班的学生经常向刘老师提出一些“稀奇古怪”的问题。比如，当她在课堂上讲太阳和月亮时，有的学生便会问：“老师，太阳为什么白天出来？月亮为什么晚上才出来？”刘老师对这样的问题还能回答。但有些学生提出的问题就让她难以应对了。比如，有的学生会问：“老师，为什么有的小朋友跟爸爸姓，有的小朋友跟妈妈姓？”“我能成为齐天大圣吗？”“你喜欢熊大还是熊二？”等等。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a4f5ac8851eccd7f9d13fa187d8b6bd7f830e663b9d620c755fc6d2b0eca40a9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1700, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1880, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 22, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "a4f5ac8851eccd7f9d13fa187d8b6bd7f830e663b9d620c755fc6d2b0eca40a9"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021b.q22"], "knowledge_node_ids": [], "ability_ids": [], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021b.q22"], "word_count": 180, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a4f5ac8851eccd7f9d13fa187d8b6bd7f830e663b9d620c755fc6d2b0eca40a9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1700, "decoded_csv_character_end": 1880, "next_source_question_number": 24, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 22, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "a4f5ac8851eccd7f9d13fa187d8b6bd7f830e663b9d620c755fc6d2b0eca40a9"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_sta