{"material_id": "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021b.q23.material.recovered", "text": "材料：刘老师讲到“白求恩不远万里来到中国”时，一个学生突然大声说：“那么远？怎么来？是坐飞机，还是坐轮船？”同学们都笑了起来。刘老师也笑了，想了想，向同学们提出了这样几个问题：白求恩来中国的方式可能有哪几种？“不远万里”又该怎样解释？这体现了白求恩的什么精神？经过热烈的讨论，同学们明白了：无论是坐飞机、轮船，还是坐汽车、马车，白求恩不远万里来到中国，这体现了他的国际主义精神。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a4f5ac8851eccd7f9d13fa187d8b6bd7f830e663b9d620c755fc6d2b0eca40a9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1946, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2135, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 23, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "a4f5ac8851eccd7f9d13fa187d8b6bd7f830e663b9d620c755fc6d2b0eca40a9"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021b.q23"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m6.k01", "ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.m7.k01"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.xiaoxue.ability.evaluate", "ntce.xiaoxue.ability.theory"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.202.r001", "ntce.outline.202.r040", "ntce.outline.202.r044", "ntce.outline.202.r045"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.xiaoxue.jiaoxue.2021b.q23"], "word_count": 189, "level": "xiaoxue", "subject": "jiaoxue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学）题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "a4f5ac8851eccd7f9d13fa187d8b6bd7f830e663b9d620c755fc6d2b0eca40a9", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 1946, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2135, "next_source_question_number": 25, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/小学真题/2021年下半年教师资格证考试《教育教学知识与能力》（小学